WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:02.750
The learning outcomes explain what you will practise In

00:00:02.842 --> 00:00:05.750
this learning unit you will prepare a clear working

00:00:05.763 --> 00:00:10.013
agreement and a reasoned decision brief The outcomes below

00:00:10.079 --> 00:00:13.132
describe the capabilities that the teaching and practice will

00:00:13.145 --> 00:00:17.053
help you develop Your practice drafts are not evidence

00:00:17.092 --> 00:00:19.868
of formal competence until they have been reviewed through

00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:24.053
the authorised assessment process What will be expected of

00:00:24.079 --> 00:00:26.882
you in this LU In this learning activity you

00:00:26.908 --> 00:00:29.829
will use the completed example and crosswalk to cover

00:00:29.855 --> 00:00:34.500
every essential agreement area Outcomes linked to this activity

00:00:34.526 --> 00:00:39.211
EA-01 . 1 Translate an executive brief into agreed

00:00:39.263 --> 00:00:45.776
support priorities deliverables and review points EA-01 . 2

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:50.276
Prepare a working agreement covering diary access decision and

00:00:50.382 --> 00:00:57.303
spending limits communication preferences confidentiality personal tasks and availability

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:03.053
EA-01 . 3 Distinguish EA responsibilities from those of

00:01:03.053 --> 00:01:06.961
a personal assistant office manager chief of staff and

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:11.092
specialist adviser and refer work outside the agreed mandate

00:01:12.066 --> 00:01:15.921
EA-01 . 5 Agree a safe route for raising

00:01:15.974 --> 00:01:21.092
concerns resolving expectations and arranging an authorised deputy without

00:01:21.158 --> 00:01:26.012
making the role dependent on permanent availability Learning practice

00:01:26.051 --> 00:01:29.222
and acknowledgement are not an assessor result or workplace

00:01:29.275 --> 00:01:30.183
authorisation
